{"subject":"math3","year":2014,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2014-1","num":1,"desc":"数列极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】由极限的保号性，即可得到 $|a_{n}|>\\dfrac{|a|}{2}$ 正确，（C）反例 $a_{n}=a-\\dfrac{2}{n}$，（D）反例 $a_{n}=a+\\dfrac{2}{n}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-2","num":2,"desc":"渐近线","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】A. $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(x+\\sin x)=\\infty$，所以 $y=x+\\sin x$ 无水平渐近线，又可知 $y=x+\\sin x$ 无垂直渐近线，又 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{x+\\sin x}{x}=1$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(x+\\sin x-x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\sin x$ 极限不存在，所以 $y=x+\\sin x$ 无斜渐近线；","B. $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(x^{2}+\\sin x)=\\infty$，所以 $y=x^{2}+\\sin x$ 无水平渐近线，又可知 $y=x^{2}+\\sin x$ 无垂直渐近线，又 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{2}+\\sin x}{x}=\\infty$，极限不存在，所以 $y=x^{2}+\\sin x$ 无斜渐近线；","C. $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(x+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x})=\\infty$，所以 $y=x+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 无水平渐近线，又可知 $y=x+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 无垂直渐近线，又 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{x+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}}{x}=1$；所以 $y=x+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 有斜渐近线 $y=x$，","D. $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(x^{2}+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x})=\\infty$，所以 $y=x^{2}+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 无水平渐近线，又可知 $y=x^{2}+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 无垂直渐近线，又 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{2}+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}}{x}=\\infty$，极限不存在，所以 $y=x^{2}+\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 无斜渐近线."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-3","num":3,"desc":"泰勒公式","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】$\\tan x=x+\\dfrac{1}{3}x^{3}+o(x^{3})$，所以由 $P(x)-\\tan x$ 是比 $x^{3}$ 高阶无穷小，得 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{P(x)-\\tan x}{x^{3}}=0$，所以","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{P(x)-\\tan x}{x^{3}}=0$, 所以 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{a+bx+cx^{2}+dx^{3}-x-\\dfrac{1}{3}x^{3}-o(x^{3})}{x^{3}}=0$, 所以 $a=0$","$b=1$, $c=0$, $d=\\dfrac{1}{3}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-4","num":4,"desc":"曲线的凹凸性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】$g(x)=f(0)(1-x)+f(1)x$，$g(0)=f(0),g(1)=f(1)$；故 $g(x)$ 实质为一条连接 $[0,f(0)],[1,f(1)]$ 的直线，所以当 $f''(x)\\geqslant0$ 时，$f(x)$ 为凹的，由图形知，$f(x)\\leqslant g(x)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-5","num":5,"desc":"行列式按列展开","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】解法一 利用行列式性质把此行列式化为拉普拉斯形式","$\\begin{vmatrix}0&a&b&0\\\\ a&0&0&b\\\\ 0&c&d&0\\\\ c&0&0&d\\end{vmatrix}=-\\begin{vmatrix}a&b&0&0\\\\ c&d&0&0\\\\ 0&0&d&c\\\\ 0&0&b&a\\end{vmatrix}=-(ad-bc)^{2}$；","解法二 按第一列展开","$\\begin{vmatrix}0&a&b&0\\\\ a&0&0&b\\\\ 0&c&d&0\\\\ c&0&0&d\\end{vmatrix}=-a\\begin{vmatrix}a&b&0\\\\ c&d&0\\\\ 0&0&d\\end{vmatrix}-c\\begin{vmatrix}a&b&0\\\\ 0&0&b\\\\ c&d&0\\end{vmatrix}$","$=-ad(ad-bc)+bc(ad-bc)$","$=-(ad-bc)^{2}$","所以正确答案为(B)."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-6","num":6,"desc":"向量组的线性相关性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(A)","【解析】①充分性","若向量组 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+k\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+l\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 线性无关，令 $k=0,l=0$，得 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}$ 线性无关.","但 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 不一定线性无关，比如若 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 时，$\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 线性相关.","从而任意常数 $k,l$，向量组 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+k\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+l\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 线性无关不是向量组 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 线性无关的充分条件.","②必要性","$(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+k\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+l\\boldsymbol{a}_{3})=(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3})\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\ 0&1\\\\ k&l\\end{pmatrix}$","令","$\\boldsymbol{C}=(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+k\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+l\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}),\\boldsymbol{A}=(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}),\\boldsymbol{B}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\ 0&1\\\\ k&l\\end{pmatrix}$,","从而 $\\boldsymbol{C}=\\boldsymbol{AB}$. $\\because$向量组 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 线性无关，$\\therefore r(\\boldsymbol{A})=3$","$\\therefore r(\\boldsymbol{C})=r(\\boldsymbol{AB})=r(\\boldsymbol{B})=2$. $\\therefore$对于任意常数 $k,l$，向量组 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+k\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+l\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 线性无关. 正确答案为(A)."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-7","num":7,"desc":"事件独立性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】$\\because$随机事件 $A$ 与 $B$ 相互独立","$\\therefore P(A-B)=P(A)-P(AB)=P(A)-P(A)P(B)=0.3$","$\\Rightarrow P(A)=0.6$","$\\therefore P(B-A)=P(B)-P(AB)=P(B)-P(A)P(B)=0.2$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-8","num":8,"desc":"正态总体抽样分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】$\\because X_{1},X_{2}$ 相互独立且均服从 $N(0,\\sigma^{2})$，$\\therefore\\dfrac{X_{1}-X_{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\sigma}\\sim N(0,1)$，","又 $\\because\\left(\\dfrac{X_{3}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(1)$，$\\dfrac{X_{1}-X_{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\sigma}$ 与 $\\left(\\dfrac{X_{3}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}$ 相互独立.","$\\therefore S=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{X_{1}-X_{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\sigma}}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\left(\\dfrac{X_{3}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}}{1}}}=\\dfrac{X_{1}-X_{2}}{\\sqrt{2}|X_{3}|}\\sim t(1)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-9","num":9,"desc":"需求函数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$20-Q$","【解析】$S(Q)=Qp=Q(20-\\dfrac{1}{2}Q)$，所以 $S'(Q)=Qp=20-Q$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-10","num":10,"desc":"平面图形的面积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{3}{2}-\\ln2$","【解析】实质为由 $y=-x$，$y=2$，$y=-\\dfrac{1}{x}$ 围成的 $Y$ 型区域，所以","$S=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{2}(-\\dfrac{1}{y}+y)dy=\\dfrac{3}{2}-\\ln2$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-11","num":11,"desc":"分部积分法","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{1}{2}$","【解析】利用分部积分得","$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{a}xe^{2x}dx=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{a}xde^{2x}=\\dfrac{1}{2}xe^{2x}\\Big|_{0}^{a}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{a}e^{2x}dx=\\dfrac{1}{2}ae^{2a}-\\dfrac{1}{4}e^{2x}\\Big|_{0}^{a}=\\dfrac{1}{2}ae^{2a}-\\dfrac{1}{4}e^{2a}+\\dfrac{1}{4}$,","$=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}a-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\right)e^{2a}+\\dfrac{1}{4}=\\dfrac{1}{4}$；所以 $\\dfrac{1}{2}a-\\dfrac{1}{4}=0$，故 $a=\\dfrac{1}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-12","num":12,"desc":"交换积分次序","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{1}{2}(e-1)$","【解析】被积函数 $\\dfrac{e^{x^{2}}}{x}-e^{y^{2}}$ 分开计算得","$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}dy\\int_{y}^{1}\\left(\\dfrac{e^{x^{2}}}{x}-e^{y^{2}}\\right)dx=\\int_{0}^{1}dy\\int_{y}^{1}\\dfrac{e^{x^{2}}}{x}dx-\\int_{0}^{1}dy\\int_{y}^{1}e^{y^{2}}dx=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{e^{x^{2}}}{x}dy-\\int_{0}^{1}dy\\int_{y}^{1}e^{y^{2}}dx$","由于 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{e^{x^{2}}}{x}dy=\\int_{0}^{1}e^{x^{2}}dx$，$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}e^{y^{2}}(y-1)dy=\\int_{0}^{1}ye^{y^{2}}dy-\\int_{0}^{1}e^{y^{2}}dy$","所以","$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{e^{x^{2}}}{x}dy-\\int_{0}^{1}dy\\int_{y}^{1}e^{y^{2}}dx=\\int_{0}^{1}e^{x^{2}}dx+\\int_{0}^{1}ye^{y^{2}}dy-\\int_{0}^{1}e^{y^{2}}dy=\\int_{0}^{1}ye^{y^{2}}dy=\\dfrac{1}{2}(e-1)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-13","num":13,"desc":"二次型","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$[-2,2]$","【解析】解法一：二次型的矩阵","$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&a\\\\ 0&-1&2\\\\ a&2&0\\end{pmatrix}$","从而知其三个特征值之和为 0.","又因为其负惯性指数为 1，所以 $|\\boldsymbol{A}|\\leqslant0$，即 $|\\boldsymbol{A}|=a^{2}-4\\leqslant0\\Rightarrow-2\\leqslant a\\leqslant2$.","解法二：$f\\left(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3}\\right)=\\left(x_{1}-ax_{3}\\right)^{2}-\\left(x_{2}-2x_{3}\\right)^{2}+\\left(4-a^{2}\\right)x_{3}^{2}$，因为负惯性指数为 1，故","$4-a^{2}\\geqslant0$，即 $-2\\leqslant a\\leqslant2$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-14","num":14,"desc":"概率密度","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{2}{5n}$","【解析】$EX_{i}^{2}=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x^{2}f(x)dx=\\int_{\\theta}^{2\\theta}x^{2}\\dfrac{2x}{3\\theta^{2}}dx=\\dfrac{5}{2}\\theta^{2}$，","从而 $E\\Bigl[c\\displaystyle\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}X_{i}^{2}\\Bigr]=cE\\Bigl[\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}X_{i}^{2}\\Bigr]=cn\\dfrac{5}{2}\\theta^{2}=\\theta^{2}$，","$\\Rightarrow c=\\dfrac{2}{5n}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-15","num":15,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{1}{2}$","【解析】","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{x}[t^{2}(e^{\\frac{1}{t}}-1)-t]dt}{x^{2}\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{x})}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{x}[t^{2}(e^{\\frac{1}{t}}-1)-t]dt}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\Bigl[x^{2}(e^{\\frac{1}{x}}-1)-x\\Bigr]$，令 $t=\\dfrac{1}{x}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to0^{+}}\\Bigl[\\left(\\dfrac{1}{t}\\right)^{2}(e^{t}-1)-\\dfrac{1}{t}\\Bigr]=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to0^{+}}\\Bigl[\\dfrac{(e^{t}-1)-t}{t^{2}}\\Bigr]=\\dfrac{1}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-16","num":16,"desc":"二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$-\\dfrac{3}{4}$","【解析】由轮换对称性得，","$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D}\\dfrac{x\\sin(\\pi\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}})}{x+y}dxdy=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\iint\\limits_{D}\\sin\\left(\\pi\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}\\right)dxdy=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}d\\theta\\int_{1}^{2}\\sin\\left(\\pi r\\right)rdr=-\\dfrac{3}{4}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-17","num":17,"desc":"多元复合函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$f(u)=\\dfrac{1}{16}(e^{4u}-4u-1)$.","【解析】由于 $\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=f'(e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}\\cos y$，$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=-f'(e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}\\sin y$，","所以","$\\cos y\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}-\\sin y\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=f'(e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}\\cos^{2}y+f'(e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}\\sin^{2}y$","$=f'(e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}=(4z+e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}$","即 $f'(e^{x}\\cos y)e^{x}=[4f(e^{x}\\cos y)+e^{x}\\cos y]e^{x}$，","所以 $f'(e^{x}\\cos y)=4f(e^{x}\\cos y)+e^{x}\\cos y$.","所以 $f'(u)=4f(u)+u$，对应的微分方程为 $y'-4y=x$，为一阶线性微分方程，","$y=e^{\\int4dx}\\left(\\int xe^{-\\int4dx}dx+C\\right)$，计算得 $y=e^{4x}\\left(\\int xe^{-4x}dx+C\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{16}(4x+1)+Ce^{4x}$，又由","$f(0)=0$ 得 $C=\\dfrac{1}{16}$，所以 $y=\\dfrac{1}{16}(e^{4x}-4x-1)$，得 $f(u)=\\dfrac{1}{16}(e^{4u}-4u-1)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-18","num":18,"desc":"幂级数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$S(x)=\\dfrac{3-x}{(1-x)^{3}},x\\in(-1,1)$","【解析】$\\displaystyle\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}(n+1)(n+3)x^{n}$ 收敛域为 $(-1,1)$. 设和函数为 $S(x)$，则","$S(x)=\\left(\\displaystyle\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}(n+3)x^{n+1}\\right)'$","$=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x}\\displaystyle\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}(n+3)x^{n+2}\\right)'=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x}\\left(\\displaystyle\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}x^{n+3}\\right)'\\right)'=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x}\\left(\\dfrac{x^{3}}{1-x}\\right)'\\right)'$","$=\\dfrac{3-x}{(1-x)^{3}}$","则 $S(x)=\\dfrac{3-x}{(1-x)^{3}},x\\in(-1,1)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-19","num":19,"desc":"积分不等式证明","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","（1）由 $g(x)$ 在闭区间 $[0,1]$ 上连续，且 $0\\leqslant g(x)\\leqslant1$，由积分的性质可得","$\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{x}0dt\\leqslant\\int_{a}^{x}g(t)dt\\leqslant\\int_{a}^{x}1dt$.","所以","$0\\leqslant\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{x}g(t)dt\\leqslant x-a$；","（2）令 $F(t)=\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{a+\\int_{a}^{t}g(x)dx}f(x)dx-\\int_{a}^{t}f(x)g(x)dx$ 则 $F(a)=0$，","$F'(t)=f\\left(\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{t}g(x)dx\\right)g(t)-f(t)g(t)$，","由 $f(x)$ 在区间 $[0,1]$ 单调增，且 $0\\leqslant g(x)\\leqslant1$，可得","$F'(t)=f\\left(a+\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{t}g(x)dx\\right)g(t)-f(t)g(t)\\leqslant f(a+t-a)g(t)-f(t)g(t)=0$.","所以，$F(t)$ 为减函数. 因此 $F(b)=\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{a+\\int_{a}^{b}g(x)dx}f(x)dx-\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)g(x)dx\\leqslant F(a)=0$.","即 $\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{a+\\int_{a}^{b}g(t)dt}f(x)dx\\leqslant\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)g(x)dx$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-20","num":20,"desc":"齐次线性方程组","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2&3&-4\\\\ 0&1&-1&1\\\\ 1&2&0&-3\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0&1\\\\ 0&1&0&-2\\\\ 0&0&1&-3\\end{pmatrix}$.","从而同解方程组为","$\\begin{cases}x_{1}=-x_{4},\\\\ x_{2}=2x_{4},\\\\ x_{3}=3x_{4}\\end{cases}$","所以方程组 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的一个基础解系为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 2\\\\ 3\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$.","（II）令 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\ 1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$，则","$(\\boldsymbol{A}|\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3})=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2&3&-4&\\vdots&1&0&0\\\\ 0&1&-1&1&\\vdots&0&1&0\\\\ 1&2&0&-3&\\vdots&0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0&1&\\vdots&2&6&-1\\\\ 0&1&0&-2&\\vdots&-1&-3&1\\\\ 0&0&1&-3&\\vdots&-1&-4&1\\end{pmatrix}$，","所以 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}$ 的一个特解为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\ -1\\\\ -1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$，","$\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}$ 的一个特解为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\ -3\\\\ -4\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$，","$\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}$ 的一个特解为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$，","所以","$\\boldsymbol{B}=\\begin{pmatrix}-k_{1}+2&-k_{2}+6&-k_{3}-1\\\\ 2k_{1}-1&2k_{2}-3&2k_{3}+1\\\\ 3k_{1}-1&3k_{2}-4&3k_{3}+1\\\\ k_{1}&k_{2}&k_{3}\\end{pmatrix},\\left(k_{1},k_{2},k_{3}\\in R\\right)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-21","num":21,"desc":"特征值与特征向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【证明】令","$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&\\cdots&1\\\\ 1&1&\\cdots&1\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ 1&1&\\cdots&1\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{B}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&\\cdots&1\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&2\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&n\\end{pmatrix}$","则","$|\\lambda\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-1&-1&\\cdots&-1\\\\ -1&\\lambda-1&\\cdots&-1\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ -1&-1&\\cdots&\\lambda-1\\end{vmatrix}=(\\lambda-n)\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&\\cdots&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda&\\cdots&0\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=\\lambda^{n-1}(\\lambda-n)=0$","$\\Rightarrow\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=\\cdots=\\lambda_{n-1}=0,\\lambda_{n}=n$，","因为 $\\boldsymbol{A}^{T}=\\boldsymbol{A}$，即 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 为实对称矩阵，","所以 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 可相似对角化，即 $\\boldsymbol{A}\\sim\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}$，其中 $\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}=\\begin{pmatrix}n&&&\\\\ &0&&\\\\ &&\\ddots&\\\\ &&&0\\end{pmatrix}$，","$|\\lambda\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{B}|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&0&\\cdots&-1\\\\ 0&\\lambda&\\cdots&-2\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&\\lambda-n\\end{vmatrix}=\\lambda^{n-1}(\\lambda-n)=0\\Rightarrow\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=\\cdots=\\lambda_{n-1}=0,\\lambda_{n}=n$.","当 $\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=\\cdots=\\lambda_{n-1}=0$ 时，$0\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{B}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&\\cdots&-1\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&-2\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&-n\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&\\cdots&1\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&0\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ 0&0&\\cdots&0\\end{pmatrix}$，","即 $r(-\\boldsymbol{B})=1$，则 $r(\\boldsymbol{B})=1$，","所以 $\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=\\cdots=\\lambda_{n-1}=0$ 对应 $n-1$ 个线性无关的特征向量，","从而 $\\boldsymbol{B}$ 可相似对角化，即 $\\boldsymbol{B}\\sim\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}$，其中 $\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}=\\begin{pmatrix}n&&&\\\\ &0&&\\\\ &&\\ddots&\\\\ &&&0\\end{pmatrix}$，所以 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{B}$ 相似."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-22","num":22,"desc":"条件分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）","$F_{Y}(y)=P\\{Y\\leqslant y\\}=P\\{Y\\leqslant y,X=1\\}+P\\{Y\\leqslant y,X=2\\}$","$=P\\{Y\\leqslant y|X=1\\}P\\{X=1\\}+P\\{Y\\leqslant y|X=2\\}P\\{X=2\\}$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\Bigl[P\\{Y\\leqslant y|X=1\\}+P\\{Y\\leqslant y|X=2\\}\\Bigr]$","当 $y<0$ 时，$F_{Y}(y)=0$；","当 $0\\leqslant y<1$ 时，$F_{Y}(y)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(y+\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{3}{4}y$；","当 $1\\leqslant y<2$ 时，$F_{Y}(y)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right)$；","当 $y\\geqslant2$ 时，$F_{Y}(y)=1$.","所以 $F_{Y}(y)=\\begin{cases}0,&y<0\\\\ \\dfrac{3}{4}y,&0\\leqslant y<1\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right),&1\\leqslant y<2\\\\ 1,&y\\geqslant2\\end{cases}$.","（II）由 $Y$ 的分布函数 $F_{Y}(y)$ 得到概率密度为","$f(y)=F_{Y}'(y)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{3}{4},&0<y<1\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{4},&1\\leqslant y<2\\\\ 0,&\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$，","则 $E(Y)=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}yf(y)dy=\\int_{0}^{1}y\\dfrac{3}{4}dy+\\int_{1}^{2}y\\dfrac{1}{4}dy=\\dfrac{3}{4}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2014-23","num":23,"desc":"二维离散型分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2014数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）由已知得 $EX=EY=\\dfrac{2}{3},EX^{2}=EY^{2}=\\dfrac{2}{3}$.","从而 $DX=DY=\\dfrac{2}{9}$，$\\rho_{XY}=\\dfrac{1}{2}=\\dfrac{EXY-EXEY}{\\sqrt{DX}\\sqrt{DY}}$，以 $EXY=\\dfrac{5}{9}$，","从而 $P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{5}{9}$.","$P\\{X=1,Y=0\\}=P\\{X=1\\}-P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{9}$","$P\\{X=0,Y=0\\}=P\\{Y=0\\}-P\\{X=1,Y=0\\}=\\dfrac{2}{9}$","$P\\{X=0,Y=1\\}=P\\{Y=1\\}-P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{9}$","即 $\\left(X,Y\\right)$ 的概率分布为","$\\begin{array}{c|cc|c} \\boldsymbol{X}\\backslash\\boldsymbol{Y} & 0 & 1 & \\\\ \\hline 0 & \\dfrac{2}{9} & \\dfrac{1}{9} & \\dfrac{1}{3} \\\\ 1 & \\dfrac{1}{9} & \\dfrac{5}{9} & \\dfrac{2}{3} \\\\ \\hline  & \\dfrac{1}{3} & \\dfrac{2}{3} & \\end{array}$","（II）$P\\{X+Y\\leqslant1\\}=P\\{X=0,Y=0\\}+P\\{X=0,Y=1\\}+P\\{X=1,Y=0\\}=\\dfrac{4}{9}$."]}]}]}